# SHA-256 allowlist for the exact helper filenames tauri-bundler 2.9.4 reads
# from ${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-$HOME/.cache}/tauri. URLs may move or be overwritten
# upstream; the pinned digest is the authority. The two linuxdeploy plugins are
# fetched from a commit-pinned ref rather than master, so upstream cannot move
# the bytes under a green build and stall every PR on a checksum_mismatch.
# linuxdeploy's second digest is its deterministic post-download form after
# Tauri zeros bytes 8..10.
# The appimage plugin's continuous asset is rebuilt monthly. Its digest below
# was verified against GitHub asset 602435573 and the 2026-10-01 upstream build:
# https://github.com/linuxdeploy/linuxdeploy-plugin-appimage/actions/runs/36815339264
# Source: 536b068787179ea901964bd7dabc7bf61e4941c3. Future changes fail closed.
